{
  "lessonId": "L1M3L2",
  "title": "五大白葡萄品種",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f39c12 0%,#f1c40f 100%)'><h1>🍾 義大利五大白葡萄品種</h1><p class='subtitle'>從 Pinot Grigio 到 Vermentino 的清新世界</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏆 五大白葡萄品種概覽</h2><div class='grape-overview'><div class='overview-card pinot'><div class='rank'>#1</div><div class='grape-name'>Pinot Grigio</div><div class='grape-region'>Veneto, Friuli</div><div class='grape-fame'>全球熱銷</div></div><div class='overview-card trebbiano'><div class='rank'>#2</div><div class='grape-name'>Trebbiano</div><div class='grape-region'>中部多產區</div><div class='grape-fame'>產量之王</div></div><div class='overview-card garganega'><div class='rank'>#3</div><div class='grape-name'>Garganega</div><div class='grape-region'>Veneto</div><div class='grape-fame'>Soave 之魂</div></div><div class='overview-card verdicchio'><div class='rank'>#4</div><div class='grape-name'>Verdicchio</div><div class='grape-region'>Marche</div><div class='grape-fame'>礦物經典</div></div><div class='overview-card vermentino'><div class='rank'>#5</div><div class='grape-name'>Vermentino</div><div class='grape-region'>Sardinia, Liguria</div><div class='grape-fame'>海岸之星</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌟 Pinot Grigio - 國際巨星</h2><div class='grape-detail'><div class='detail-header pinot-bg'><h3>Pinot Grigio / Pinot Gris</h3><p>灰皮諾（皮色灰紫）</p></div><div class='detail-grid'><div class='detail-section'><h4>🎨 視覺特徵</h4><ul><li>淡黃色帶綠色調</li><li>清澈透明</li><li>有時帶銅色（接觸皮）</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>👃 香氣</h4><ul><li><strong>果香：</strong>青蘋果、梨子、柑橘</li><li><strong>花香：</strong>白花、金銀花</li><li><strong>其他：</strong>蜂蜜、杏仁（高品質）</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>👅 口感</h4><ul><li><strong>酸度：</strong>中到高（清爽）</li><li><strong>酒體：</strong>輕到中等</li><li><strong>酒精度：</strong>12-13.5%</li><li><strong>風格：</strong>清新、易飲</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>🍷 代表酒款</h4><ul><li><strong>Friuli Pinot Grigio DOC</strong>（最優質）</li><li>Trentino-Alto Adige DOC</li><li>Veneto IGT（大眾市場）</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>🍴 配餐</h4><ul><li>沙拉、開胃菜</li><li>清蒸魚、海鮮</li><li>白肉、義大利麵</li><li>壽司、生魚片</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>💡 特色</h4><ul><li>義大利出口量最大白酒</li><li>易飲、百搭、價格友善</li><li>適飲期: 1-3 年（趁新鮮）</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌾 Trebbiano - 產量巨人</h2><div class='grape-detail'><div class='detail-header trebbiano-bg'><h3>Trebbiano</h3><p>義大利種植最廣的白葡萄</p></div><div class='detail-grid'><div class='detail-section'><h4>🎨 視覺特徵</h4><ul><li>淡黃色、淺色</li><li>清澈透明</li><li>通常顏色很淡</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>👃 香氣</h4><ul><li><strong>果香：</strong>青蘋果、檸檬、白桃</li><li><strong>風格：</strong>中性、清淡</li><li><strong>高品質：</strong>白花、礦物</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>👅 口感</h4><ul><li><strong>酸度：</strong>高（爽口）</li><li><strong>酒體：</strong>輕到中等</li><li><strong>酒精度：</strong>11-12.5%</li><li><strong>風格：</strong>簡單、清爽</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>🍷 代表酒款</h4><ul><li><strong>Trebbiano d'Abruzzo DOC</strong></li><li>Orvieto DOC（混釀）</li><li>Soave DOC（少量混釀）</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>🍴 配餐</h4><ul><li>炸海鮮</li><li>清淡魚類</li><li>沙拉、開胃菜</li><li>日常餐酒</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>💡 用途</h4><ul><li>大眾市場日常酒</li><li>混釀基酒</li><li>也用於釀造 Balsamic 醋</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Garganega - Soave 之魂</h2><div class='grape-detail'><div class='detail-header garganega-bg'><h3>Garganega</h3><p>Veneto 的優雅白葡萄</p></div><div class='detail-grid'><div class='detail-section'><h4>🎨 視覺特徵</h4><ul><li>淡黃綠色</li><li>透明度高</li><li>陳年後轉金黃</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>👃 香氣</h4><ul><li><strong>果香：</strong>白桃、杏桃、檸檬</li><li><strong>花香：</strong>杏花、金銀花</li><li><strong>特色：</strong>杏仁香（獨特）</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>👅 口感</h4><ul><li><strong>酸度：</strong>中到高</li><li><strong>酒體：</strong>中等到飽滿</li><li><strong>酒精度：</strong>11.5-13%</li><li><strong>特色：</strong>礦物感、鮮度</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>🍷 代表酒款</h4><ul><li><strong>Soave Classico DOCG</strong>（最優質）</li><li>Soave DOC</li><li>Recioto di Soave DOCG（甜白）</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>🍴 配餐</h4><ul><li>淡水魚、鱸魚</li><li>白肉、雞肉</li><li>清爽義大利麵</li><li>蔬菜料理</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>⏱️ 陳年潛力</h4><ul><li>Soave Classico: 3-8 年</li><li>單一園：5-12 年</li><li>杏仁香隨陳年增強</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>💎 Verdicchio & Vermentino</h2><div class='two-grapes'><div class='grape-detail half'><div class='detail-header verdicchio-bg'><h3>Verdicchio</h3><p>Marche 的礦物瑰寶</p></div><div class='detail-content'><div class='content-item'><strong>🎨 視覺：</strong>淡黃綠、清澈明亮</div><div class='content-item'><strong>👃 香氣：</strong>檸檬、青蘋果、白花、礦物、海鹽</div><div class='content-item'><strong>👅 口感：</strong>高酸度、礦物感、中等酒體、清爽</div><div class='content-item'><strong>🍷 代表：</strong>Verdicchio dei Castelli di Jesi DOC</div><div class='content-item'><strong>🍴 配餐：</strong>生蠔、貝類、炸海鮮、亞洲料理</div><div class='content-item'><strong>⏱️ 陳年：</strong>3-10 年（Riserva）</div><div class='content-item'><strong>💡 特色：</strong>獨特魚形瓶（Anfora）</div></div></div><div class='grape-detail half'><div class='detail-header vermentino-bg'><h3>Vermentino</h3><p>地中海海岸之星</p></div><div class='detail-content'><div class='content-item'><strong>🎨 視覺：</strong>淡金黃色、明亮</div><div class='content-item'><strong>👃 香氣：</strong>檸檬、葡萄柚、青草、海風、香草</div><div class='content-item'><strong>👅 口感：</strong>中高酸度、清新、礦物感、海鹽味</div><div class='content-item'><strong>🍷 代表：</strong>Vermentino di Gallura DOCG（Sardinia）</div><div class='content-item'><strong>🍴 配餐：</strong>海鮮料理、烤魚、地中海沙拉</div><div class='content-item'><strong>🌊 特色：</strong>海岸風土、鹹鮮感</div><div class='content-item'><strong>💰 價格：</strong>$$（物超所值）</div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📊 五大品種對比</h2><div class='comparison-table'><table><tr><th>品種</th><th>酸度</th><th>酒體</th><th>主要風味</th><th>適飲期</th><th>價格帶</th><th>適合場合</th></tr><tr><td><strong>Pinot Grigio</strong></td><td>中-高</td><td>輕-中</td><td>青蘋果、梨子</td><td>1-3 年</td><td>$-$$</td><td>日常、開胃</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Trebbiano</strong></td><td>高</td><td>輕-中</td><td>檸檬、青蘋果</td><td>1-2 年</td><td>$</td><td>日常餐酒</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Garganega</strong></td><td>中-高</td><td>中-飽滿</td><td>白桃、杏仁</td><td>3-12 年</td><td>$$-$$$</td><td>正餐、宴客</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Verdicchio</strong></td><td>高</td><td>中</td><td>檸檬、礦物、海鹽</td><td>3-10 年</td><td>$$</td><td>海鮮料理</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Vermentino</strong></td><td>中-高</td><td>中</td><td>柑橘、海風、香草</td><td>2-5 年</td><td>$$</td><td>海岸度假</td></tr></table></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍴 配餐建議總覽</h2><div class='pairing-grid'><div class='pairing-category'><h4>🐟 海鮮料理</h4><ul><li><strong>生蠔、貝類</strong> → Verdicchio</li><li><strong>烤魚、鱸魚</strong> → Garganega (Soave)</li><li><strong>炸海鮮</strong> → Trebbiano, Vermentino</li><li><strong>壽司</strong> → Pinot Grigio</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-category'><h4>🥗 輕食沙拉</h4><ul><li><strong>綠沙拉</strong> → Pinot Grigio</li><li><strong>地中海沙拉</strong> → Vermentino</li><li><strong>凱薩沙拉</strong> → Garganega</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-category'><h4>🍝 義大利麵</h4><ul><li><strong>白酒蛤蜊麵</strong> → Verdicchio</li><li><strong>奶油培根麵</strong> → Pinot Grigio</li><li><strong>青醬麵</strong> → Vermentino</li><li><strong>橄欖油蒜香麵</strong> → Trebbiano</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-category'><h4>🧀 起司</h4><ul><li><strong>新鮮 Mozzarella</strong> → Pinot Grigio</li><li><strong>Ricotta</strong> → Garganega</li><li><strong>Pecorino（輕熟）</strong> → Vermentino</li></ul></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Pinot Grigio 是義大利出口量最大的白酒，風格清爽易飲</div><div class='point'>✓ Trebbiano 種植最廣，產量最大，適合日常飲用</div><div class='point'>✓ Garganega 釀造 Soave，以獨特的杏仁香聞名</div><div class='point'>✓ Verdicchio 以高酸度和礦物感著稱，海鮮絕配</div><div class='point'>✓ Vermentino 是海岸產區之星，帶有鮮明的海風鹹鮮感</div></div></section></div><style>.grape-overview{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:15px}.overview-card{background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);transition:transform .3s}.overview-card:hover{transform:translateY(-8px)}.rank{width:50px;height:50px;background:#f39c12;color:#fff;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin:0 auto 12px}.grape-name{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;margin:10px 0}.grape-region{color:#7f8c8d;font-size:.9rem;margin:5px 0}.grape-fame{color:#f39c12;font-weight:600;margin-top:8px;font-size:.9rem}.grape-detail{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);margin:20px 0}.detail-header{padding:25px;color:#fff;text-align:center}.pinot-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3498db,#2980b9)}.trebbiano-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#95a5a6,#7f8c8d)}.garganega-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085,#1abc9c)}.verdicchio-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#27ae60,#2ecc71)}.vermentino-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e67e22,#d35400)}.detail-header h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.8rem}.detail-header p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;opacity:.9}.detail-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;padding:25px}.detail-section h4{margin:0 0 12px;color:#f39c12;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #ecf0f1;padding-bottom:8px}.detail-section ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:2}.detail-section li{color:#555}.detail-section strong{color:#2c3e50}.two-grapes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.half{box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.detail-content{padding:25px}.content-item{padding:12px 15px;margin:8px 0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f8f9fa,transparent);border-left:4px solid;line-height:1.6}.verdicchio-bg + .detail-content .content-item{border-color:#27ae60}.vermentino-bg + .detail-content .content-item{border-color:#e67e22}.comparison-table{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.comparison-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.95rem}.comparison-table th{background:#f39c12;color:#fff;padding:14px;text-align:left;font-size:.9rem}.comparison-table td{padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0}.comparison-table tr:hover{background:#fef5e7}.comparison-table strong{color:#f39c12}.pairing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px}.pairing-category{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #f39c12;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.pairing-category h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#f39c12;font-size:1.2rem}.pairing-category ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:2.2}.pairing-category li{color:#2c3e50}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fef5e7,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #f39c12;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style>",
  "quiz": [
    {
      "question": "義大利出口量最大的白葡萄酒是？",
      "options": ["Trebbiano", "Pinot Grigio", "Garganega", "Vermentino"],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Pinot Grigio 是義大利出口量最大的白葡萄酒，在全球市場非常受歡迎。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Soave 主要使用哪個葡萄品種釀造？",
      "options": ["Pinot Grigio", "Trebbiano", "Garganega", "Verdicchio"],
      "answer": 2,
      "explanation": "Soave（尤其是 Soave Classico DOCG）主要使用 Garganega 葡萄釀造，以杏仁香聞名。"
    },
    {
      "question": "哪個品種以獨特的魚形瓶（Anfora）包裝聞名？",
      "options": ["Vermentino", "Verdicchio", "Garganega", "Trebbiano"],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Verdicchio dei Castelli di Jesi 傳統上使用魚形瓶（Anfora）包裝，非常具有辨識度。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Vermentino 的特色風味是？",
      "options": ["杏仁、白桃", "檸檬、礦物、海鹽", "柑橘、海風、香草", "青蘋果、梨子"],
      "answer": 2,
      "explanation": "Vermentino 生長於海岸產區，帶有明顯的柑橘、海風和鹹鮮感，是其獨特之處。"
    }
  ]
}
